<p>Additional Greene County Court Records can be found on microfilm at the Library of Virginia.  Consult <extref xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://www.lva.virginia.gov/public/local/results_all.asp?CountyID=VA009">"A Guide to Virginia County and City Records on Microfilm"</extref>
</p>
